vestors who simultaneously meet four intersection conditions: (1) belong to the Gold category, (2) have a diversification score below 50, (3) hold at least one Corporate Bond position, and (4) have a positive allocation to the Automobile sector. Since investors can have multiple holdings and sector allocations, a pre-aggregate strategy ensures correct handling of one-to-many relationships before applying the intersection filters. The output returns the identifiers and names of qualifying investors.", "structural_repairs": [], "contract_errors": [], "contract_warnings": []}, "generated_sparql": "PREFIX rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>
